{"logId": "c0e4b869-f6b4-4c7c-8a5f-deb9f6cbca0f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [320, 121, 887, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [887.0, 121.0], [887.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：能够积极理性地寻找有效的方法沟通，彼此达成尊重对方思想观念和生活态度的共识，享受普遍价值观下的亲情状态。（尊重）", "block_bbox": [308, 232, 1549, 310], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[308.0, 232.0], [1549.0, 232.0], [1549.0, 310.0], [308.0, 310.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：享受亲情的美好，有良好的沟通方法引导或处理观念代沟。对于价值观相悖的方面，不强求对方按照自己的思想去做，虽然思想观念不同和对问题、对事物的看法和生活的态度不同，但能够相互尊重、求同存异，理解和支持对方按照自我意愿去活。彼此坚定地给予爱和后盾的力量。", "block_bbox": [309, 341, 1541, 466], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 341.0], [1541.0, 341.0], [1541.0, 466.0], [309.0, 466.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 520, 482, 552], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 520.0], [482.0, 520.0], [482.0, 552.0], [311.0, 552.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、与父母有良好的表达爱的方式（如关怀问候、与父母拥抱等的习惯）", "block_bbox": [336, 579, 1156, 610], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 579.0], [1156.0, 579.0], [1156.0, 610.0], [336.0, 610.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、能够没有顾忌地、坦诚地与父母敞开心扉交流", "block_bbox": [337, 624, 911, 655], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 624.0], [911.0, 624.0], [911.0, 655.0], [337.0, 655.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、对彼此不同的观念，能够相互尊重、欣赏和认可", "block_bbox": [337, 669, 935, 700], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 669.0], [935.0, 669.0], [935.0, 700.0], [337.0, 700.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、通过有效的方式方法，一定程度上引导父母更加健康、品质的生活观念和习惯", "block_bbox": [337, 714, 1278, 745], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 714.0], [1278.0, 714.0], [1278.0, 745.0], [337.0, 745.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、鼓励父母多接触、尝试新鲜事物，有属于自己的爱好", "block_bbox": [337, 758, 989, 789], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 758.0], [989.0, 758.0], [989.0, 789.0], [337.0, 789.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、对父母在家庭关系中不正确的思想和行为，及时制止和沟通引导", "block_bbox": [337, 804, 1120, 834], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 804.0], [1120.0, 804.0], [1120.0, 834.0], [337.0, 834.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、活好自己的生命，是对父母最大的孝顺和报答", "block_bbox": [338, 848, 911, 879], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 848.0], [911.0, 848.0], [911.0, 879.0], [338.0, 879.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "58", "block_bbox": [917, 969, 955, 992], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[917.0, 969.0], [954.0, 969.0], [954.0, 991.0], [917.0, 991.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8736972212791443, "coordinate": [320, 121, 887, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [887.0, 121.0], [887.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6362694501876831, "coordinate": [308, 232, 1549, 310], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[308.0, 232.0], [1549.0, 232.0], [1549.0, 310.0], [308.0, 310.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9507272839546204, "coordinate": [309, 341, 1541, 466], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 341.0], [1541.0, 341.0], [1541.0, 466.0], [309.0, 466.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7902505993843079, "coordinate": [311, 520, 482, 552], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 520.0], [482.0, 520.0], [482.0, 552.0], [311.0, 552.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8510329723358154, "coordinate": [336, 579, 1156, 610], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 579.0], [1156.0, 579.0], [1156.0, 610.0], [336.0, 610.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8343825936317444, "coordinate": [337, 624, 911, 655], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 624.0], [911.0, 624.0], [911.0, 655.0], [337.0, 655.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8425549864768982, "coordinate": [337, 669, 935, 700], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 669.0], [935.0, 669.0], [935.0, 700.0], [337.0, 700.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8609330654144287, "coordinate": [337, 714, 1278, 745], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 714.0], [1278.0, 714.0], [1278.0, 745.0], [337.0, 745.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8416434526443481, "coordinate": [337, 758, 989, 789], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 758.0], [989.0, 758.0], [989.0, 789.0], [337.0, 789.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.86577308177948, "coordinate": [337, 804, 1120, 834], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 804.0], [1120.0, 804.0], [1120.0, 834.0], [337.0, 834.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8477305769920349, "coordinate": [338, 848, 911, 879], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[338.0, 848.0], [911.0, 848.0], [911.0, 879.0], [338.0, 879.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7175261378288269, "coordinate": [917, 969, 955, 992], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[917.0, 969.0], [954.0, 969.0], [954.0, 991.0], [917.0, 991.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## 三 级【2~3分】：能够积极理性地寻找有效的方法沟通，彼此达成尊重对方思想观念和生活态度的共识，享受普遍价值观下的亲情状态。（尊重）\n\n- 本条释义：享受亲情的美好，有良好的沟通方法引导或处理观念代沟。对于价值观相悖的方面，不强求对方按照自己的思想去做，虽然思想观念不同和对问题、对事物的看法和生活的态度不同，但能够相互尊重、求同存异，理解和支持对方按照自我意愿去活。彼此坚定地给予爱和后盾的力量。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、与父母有良好的表达爱的方式（如关怀问候、与父母拥抱等的习惯）\n\n2、能够没有顾忌地、坦诚地与父母敞开心扉交流\n\n3、对彼此不同的观念，能够相互尊重、欣赏和认可\n\n4、通过有效的方式方法，一定程度上引导父母更加健康、品质的生活观念和习惯\n\n5、鼓励父母多接触、尝试新鲜事物，有属于自己的爱好\n\n6、对父母在家庭关系中不正确的思想和行为，及时制止和沟通引导\n\n7、活好自己的生命，是对父母最大的孝顺和报答", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0e4b869-f6b4-4c7c-8a5f-deb9f6cbca0f/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A13Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc5616989c695112615b77ea1c56232cc51da47468944d7b3e9b9cf93eef3e9b2"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0e4b869-f6b4-4c7c-8a5f-deb9f6cbca0f/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A13Z%2F-1%2F%2F2d1be0063291d8e8ef5aa76143c9aacfde3e6fdfc48d5ff5c96bff5fe5a1a64d"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0e4b869-f6b4-4c7c-8a5f-deb9f6cbca0f/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A14Z%2F-1%2F%2Feaf7f8b5d3db9bd81f7a0390ba89ef344898183f72432cc40033dc67c2a7eb1c"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
